  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Hey Jude - Pet-Friendly Luxury Vacation Rental with Private Pool and Beach Views<br><br>Favorite Features:<br>- Private Pool (Heat Available)<br>- Gulf View<br>- Pets Allowed<br>- Bunk Rooms<br>- Golf Cart <br><br>More about Hey Jude:<br>Welcome to Hey Jude, a luxurious retreat in the heart of Gulf Place, thoughtfully designed for unforgettable gatherings with family and friends. This stunning home comfortably sleeps up to 26 guests with 7 king bedrooms and 3 spacious bunkrooms, offering everyone their own slice of comfort and privacy. The modern interior is elevated with a touch of glam—from sleek finishes and stylish furnishings to multiple living rooms that provide the perfect balance of relaxation and connection.<br><br>The kitchen is a true standout, fully equipped with top-of-the-line professional appliances that make cooking for a crowd a joy. Just a two-minute stroll from both the beach and the vibrant energy of Gulf Place—with boutique shopping, live music, and dining favorites like Shunk Gulley—you'll find everything you need within easy reach.<br><br>Step outside and discover your own lush, private oasis. The fenced backyard is a dream for both people and pets, featuring green grass, tropical landscaping, and plenty of room to relax or play. The private pool—with optional heat and a built-in table for poolside drinks or card games—invites endless hours of sun-soaked fun. Nearby, a bubbling hot tub offers a peaceful escape, while the fully-equipped outdoor kitchen makes alfresco dining a breeze. Grill up a feast with the built-in grill, griddle, warming drawer, mini fridge, and gas burner perfect for low country boils.<br><br>Extras like a golf cart, four bikes, and two sets of backpack beach chairs make it easy to explore all that 30A has to offer. Whether you're gathering for a celebration, a reunion, or simply a coastal escape, Hey Jude offers a seamless blend of luxury, comfort, and laid-back charm.<br>All you need is love… and a stay at Hey Jude!<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements:<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>Bedroom 1: 2 Twin over Twin Bunks.<br>Bedroom 2: King Bed & Ensuite Bathroom with Shower.<br>Bedroom 3: King Bed & Shared Bathroom with Shower.<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>Bedroom 4: King Bed & Ensuite Bathroom with Shower.<br>Bedroom 5: King Bed & Ensuite Bathroom with Shower. <br>Bedroom 6: 2 Twin over Twin Bunks.<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>Bedroom 7: King Bed & Ensuite Bathroom with Shower.<br>Bedroom 8: King Bed with Shared Balcony & Ensuite Bathroom with Shower.<br>Bedroom 9: King Bed & Ensuite Bathroom with Shower & Soaking Tub.<br>Bedroom 10: 2 Twin over Twin Bunks.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Hey Jude - Pet Friendly 30A Vacation Home with Secluded Pool Space & Beach View"
        }
      ],
